  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>11</mn></math> arithmetic means are inserted between <math><mn>28</mn></math> and <math><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the number of integral arithmetic means are"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>7</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msub></math> be <math><mn>11</mn></math> A.M.’s between <math><mn>28</mn></math> and <math><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>10</mn></math> are in A.P</p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> be the common difference of A.P.<br />Also, the number of terms <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>13</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Number of integral A.M.’s are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
